The 2024 Volkswagen Touareg is available with a 3.0L V6 TDI engine in various markets. There are two power outputs for the V6 TDI: 231 hp (170 kW) and 286 hp (210 kW). Torque figures are 500 Nm (369 lb-ft) for the 231 hp version and 600 Nm (442-443 lb-ft) for the 286 hp version.

Here's the evaluation based on the 2024 Volkswagen Touareg V6 TDI:

-   **price_usd**: Prices vary by market and trim. UK prices for the V6 TDI start around £54,000 - £67,780 for the 231hp Black Edition and £70,460 for the 286hp Black Edition. Australian prices start around $89,240 AUD for the 170TDI (231hp). Converting £60,000 (mid-range) to USD is roughly $76,000. This is above the market average ($52,000). Score: -0.20.
